    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the Recovery Squad!<br>Long-term coma issues? Sleep quality problems?<br>They have come to an end in this century!<br><br>We can provide you with professional equipment and secure measures to enter the world of patients, rescuing them and becoming their heroes!<br>Now the top consciousness recovery organization, the Recovery Team needs your help!<br>Anyone can handle it; we look forward to your joining!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>Interlinking scenes to solve puzzles, uncovering the truth through communication.<br>You will search for clues in the scene, unravel the predicament the character is in, decide how to act based on some hints, and sometimes there will be obstacles preventing the character from progressing, so observe your surroundings to find a solution!",
